    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Lagrange Points:\nEach Lagrange point has a marker and a spaceship. L1-L3
    are unstable and the ship is placed at the L point. L4-L5 are stable (in this
    case) and the ships are given a slight displacement. They then exhibit tadpole
    orbits. \n\nA co-rotating camera is used F2-F6 switch the camera anchor through
    the Lagrange points. A co-rotating trail is used for each spaceship."
